    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27569" root="ظفر" body-key="Z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَفَرٌ</span></b> , in a man, The <i>quality of having long
nails.</i> (ISk, S, O.) [App., in this sense, an
inf. n. of which the verb is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَفِرَ</span>; as it is in other
senses: see 1.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَفَرَةٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  Also <i>Low,</i>
or <i>depressed, ground,</i> (S, O, K,) <i>that produces
plants,</i> or <i>herbage.</i> (S, O.)

